---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout 
  title="Public Speaking & Presentation Coaching | Kim Baillie"
  description="Public speaking training, presentation coaching, and speech structures for engineers, architects, executives, and professionals by Kim Baillie."
  ogImage="/images/speaking.jpg"
>
  <nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
    <a href="/">Home</a>
    <span class="separator">&rsaquo;</span>
    <span aria-current="page">Public Speaking</span>
  </nav>

  <article class="content-box">
    <h1>Public Speaking & Presentation Coaching</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      For many years in the corporate world, I provided specialized public speaking and presentation training, coaching, and mentoring for professionals—particularly engineers, architects, and quantity surveyors—for whom public speaking is often a chore.
    </p>

    <div style="margin: 2rem 0; text-align: center;">
      <img src="/images/speaking.jpg" alt="Kim Baillie Public Speaking Coaching" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: var(--shadow);" />
    </div>

    <p>
      Speaking in public or delivering high-stakes boardroom presentations does not have to be an intimidating trial. With clear speech structures, effective timing, and practical templates, anyone can communicate their expertise clearly and persuasively.
    </p>

    <p>
      Much of this practical experience, speech preparation guides, and presentation templates are available through my dedicated coaching website, <strong>Talking in Public</strong>.
    </p>

    <div style="background: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; padding: 2rem; margin-top: 2.5rem; text-align: center;">
      <h2 style="margin-top: 0; font-family: var(--font-serif); color: var(--text-dark);">Explore Presentation Coaching & Templates</h2>
      <p style="color: var(--text-muted); max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto 1.5rem auto;">
        Visit Talking in Public for speech preparation templates, confidence-building techniques, and intensive presentation coaching resources.
      </p>
      <a href="https://www.talkinginpublic.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn" style="max-width: 320px; margin: 0 auto;">
        Visit TalkingInPublic.com &rarr;
      </a>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
